		does: ['Stands for the iOS and Android app', 'Round 1: a Dark tile with the logo white, the app’s own look'],
		doesNot: [
			'Takes no colour of its own',
			'Never the green of On-premises or TBMQ',
			'Not a phone drawing (Pricing’s is a red mark)',
