		does: ['Stands for the protocol bridge: devices that speak other protocols', 'A White tile, in its own colours'],
		doesNot: ['Its Colour tile is a draft', 'Not redrawn in Round 2 unless the new marks make it look off'],
	},
	tbmq: {
