				The four surfaces every check and preview on this page uses. Each will take a Tint and a backdrop of its own;
				until then one Dark stands for every dark surface.
			</p>
			<div class="pr-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Grounds" tabindex="0">
				<table class="pr-table pr-grounds">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th scope="col">Ground</th>
							<th scope="col">Base</th>
							<th scope="col">Stands for</th>
							<th scope="col">Tint</th>
							<th scope="col">Backdrop</th>
